      "audit_release": "0.84.59",
      "source_checked_date": "2026-11-17",
      "scope_note": "This is live intravesical BCG, not a checkpoint inhibitor; exclude systemic checkpoint-toxicity templates. NCCP v2 review date 06/10/2026 has passed. Current catalogue still links this document; retain review-date flag. NCCP lists immune deficiency/immunosuppression as cautions; BCG-medac SmPC contraindicates immunosuppressed use. Withhold pending product-specific urology/pharmacy review. Asymptomatic bacteriuria/leucocyturia alone is not an automatic BCG-medac contraindication. Do not turn a positive dipstick alone into a symptomatic-UTI diagnosis. Suspected systemic BCG infection needs urgent infectious-disease/urology assessment; it may present years later."
    },
